Scenario Every group that has an account in it is a heading
Description One heading per kind of account, in the order the groups are
Description declared, and nothing above them. A card is under Credit and a
Description mortgage under Loan & Debt; neither the word Asset nor the word
Description Liability is on the page, because the list is for reaching an
Description account and the balance sheet is where the two sides are read.
