| Path                 | Type       | Placeholder |
| Assets:Checking      | Checking   | false       |
| Assets:Savings       | Savings    | false       |
| Assets:Brokerage     | Brokerage  | false       |
| Assets:House         | RealEstate | false       |
| Liabilities:Visa     | CreditCard | false       |
| Liabilities:Mortgage | Mortgage   | false       |
Given postings are : PostingRow
| Ref | Date       | Payee | Account              | Amount     |
| T1  | 2026-01-05 | Open  | Assets:Checking      | 2455.00    |
| T2  | 2026-01-05 | Open  | Assets:Savings       | 500.00     |
| T3  | 2026-01-05 | Open  | Assets:Brokerage     | 9000.00    |
| T4  | 2026-01-05 | Open  | Assets:House         | 200000.00  |
| T5  | 2026-01-05 | Open  | Liabilities:Visa     | -89.99     |
| T6  | 2026-01-05 | Open  | Liabilities:Mortgage | -150000.00 |
When account list shown
Then account list rows are : AccountListRow
| Group            | Account              | Name      | Indent | Balance   | IsHeading |
| Banking          | none                 | none      | 0      | 2955.00   | true      |
| none             | Assets:Checking      | Checking  | 1      | 2455.00   | false     |
| none             | Assets:Savings       | Savings   | 1      | 500.00    | false     |
| Credit           | none                 | none      | 0      | 89.99     | true      |
| none             | Liabilities:Visa     | Visa      | 1      | 89.99     | false     |
| Investments      | none                 | none      | 0      | 9000.00   | true      |
| none             | Assets:Brokerage     | Brokerage | 1      | 9000.00   | false     |
| LoanAndDebt      | none                 | none      | 0      | 150000.00 | true      |
| none             | Liabilities:Mortgage | Mortgage  | 1      | 150000.00 | false     |
| PropertyAndAsset | none                 | none      | 0      | 200000.00 | true      |
| none             | Assets:House         | House     | 1      | 200000.00 | false     |
# Every figure is the display balance, so the card and the mortgage read as
# what is owed. Business and Transfer have nothing in them and are left out.
# The Group cell holds the group's name; what the heading reads on the page is
# the Heading column of the rule above, so this list shows Loan & Debt and
# Property & Asset.

