Scenario An import with a report in front is refused
Description There is no register to compare against, so there is nothing to
Description judge a proposed row by. Said rather than guessed at: importing
Description into whichever register happened to be open last is how a
Description statement ends up in the wrong account.
Given the chart of accounts is as previous
Given postings are as previous
When report run : ReportSpec Vertical
| GroupBy  | Category   |
| From     | 2026-01-01 |
| To       | 2026-12-31 |
| Interval | Whole      |
When import asked for
Then the import is refused saying
"""
Open the register this statement is for, then import into it.
"""

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The second pane, which belongs to an import
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

Description One pane, showing the register of the selected account. A second
Description pane exists only while an import is waiting to be accepted.
Details That is the whole rule. An import is shown beside the register it is
Details about to change, because that is what makes a proposed row judgeable:
Details the question is always whether this row is already in that register.
Details When the import is accepted or cancelled there is nothing left to
Details compare, so the second pane goes and the register it was beside is
Details what remains.
Details
Details There used to be a Split view on the menu, two registers side by side
Details for reading two accounts at once. It is gone. A window that can be left
Details in a two-register state shows two registers on the next launch with
Details nothing to say why, and the state it is really for -- an import under
Details review -- is the one case that can say why for itself. Reading two
Details accounts at once is worth having again one day as two windows, not as
Details a mode this one can be left in.

Scenario There is one pane until an import opens a second
Given the chart of accounts is as previous
Given postings are as previous
When account selected : AccountSelect
| Path            |
