| 2    | 2026-02-03 | Unknown Shop  | Assets:Checking | Expenses:Uncategorized | -23.75  | New         |
| 3    | 2026-01-15 | Harris Teeter | Assets:Checking | Expenses:Groceries     | -45.00  | Duplicate   |

Scenario An import opens in the second pane with every row proposed
Description Splitting happens by itself if the view was not split: the point of
Description showing an import here is to have the register beside it.
